      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `select_voice.py` file that lists or selects a voice for a target locale, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. Given the task, Amazon Polly is a suitable choice as it provides a wide range of voices and locales. I will use the `boto3` library to interact with Amazon Polly. The code will include importing the `boto3` library and making a call to the Polly service to list available voices for a specified locale. </thinking>\n",
