    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file synthesize_ssml.py that synthesizes SSML with voice and prosody controls using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Polly service. Amazon Polly is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Polly client to synthesize SSML. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861116243,
          "start": 1789861113839
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc092fef001ZkE0QZELbaykLW",
